{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ZyCQY0JD5g1793693262.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>近日網上流傳一段車 Cam 片段，直擊一名中年大叔在火炭路橫越三條行車道，迫使多輛車輛現場慢駛避讓，過程被上載至網絡後引發熱議。</p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-03-15h37m12s362.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026dysErEkXlS1793693226.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>片中所見，事發時車 Cam 車主沿火炭路往路口方向前行。當車輛接近路口時，一名穿着休閒服飾的中年大叔突然在馬路中間出現，並橫跨三條行車線前進。當時路面上有多輛私家車及巴士行駛，駕駛者見狀紛紛慢駛避讓，情況相當危險。</p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-03-15h37m14s479.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026mZMVOApjTw1793693233.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>相關片段引發廣泛關注，不少網民批評該大叔忽視道路安全，指附近設有過路設施，質疑其為節省時間而冒險，留言指：「貪方便遲早出事」、「大地任佢行！」及「完全唔驚車囉」。同時，亦有網民關注若不幸發生碰撞時的責任劃分，質疑：「出事邊個責任？」。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T08:42:48.483708+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":290,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T08:06:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T00:38:15.771407+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T08:39:00.928112+00:00","content_hash":"db041ab6665d881c7508e4348dba5cc5a16aa20ebddf119346474e8500446c1f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T08:42:48.483708+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}